Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.39,0:00:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.58,0:00:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（秀太）你的未来我把它拍下来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看，就在这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.85,0:00:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上面拍着你的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗输了之后倒下的你的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种造假的照片{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.43,0:00:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁会信啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.95,0:00:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（秀太）拍进照片里的未来是无法改变的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我按下快门的那一瞬间它就已经确定了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.05,0:00:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（秀太）我拍下的照片里会映出未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.81,0:00:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而它……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.85,0:00:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必定会成为现实。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.28,0:01:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）鲨鱼那家伙 居然真的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.68,0:01:02.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要用决斗来复仇。 唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.99,0:01:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼：我 要在这里向你复仇！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.53,0:01:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 别再和我扯上关系了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.08,0:01:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不只是鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.77,0:01:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个叫什么的家伙也…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}：那因痛苦而扭曲的脸…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.32,0:01:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来我也有服务的价值啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.36,0:01:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是我的粉丝福利 收下吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.23,0:01:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗 不是复仇的工具！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.10,0:01:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗 也不是用来伤害别人的东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.81,0:01:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗者 大家都是伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.41,0:01:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可为什么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.23,0:01:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐 你看游马。 飞艇。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.91,0:01:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是嘉年华举办的纪念特别航班哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.61,0:01:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要不要乘上去换换心情？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从空中看看心园市吧。来看看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好什么好啊，怎么可能好。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.27,0:01:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧，不错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.69,0:01:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能好啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.55,0:02:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明应该很开心的明明是同伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.08,0:02:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会… 当然当然是同伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.28,0:02:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我才想让你打起精神来…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.80,0:02:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.83,0:02:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊，人家明明是在担心你！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算了，随你便吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.09,0:02:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）不去追她吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.53,0:02:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟是真心在担心你。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烦死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.65,0:02:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你给我闭嘴。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.49,0:02:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.86,0:02:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）速见秀太！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 有好几次他拿着照片来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被主编说缺乏冲击力还是什么的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被批得相当惨。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可如今他拿了报道大奖{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成了崭露头角的报道摄影师。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.69,0:04:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个净拍些甜腻腻照片的小子{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在居然一张接一张地拍出独家照片{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.25,0:04:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让全世界都震惊了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.95,0:04:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是世事难料啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 关于你的工作{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去和那个速见秀太取得联系。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.73,0:04:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.74,0:04:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之 去说服他{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.93,0:04:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让他和我们公司签下独占契约。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.45,0:04:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据情报
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他正在参加决斗嘉年华。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在所在的位置是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）真是的，为什么是我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.15,0:05:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种照片到底算怎么回事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.05,0:05:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是假的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这上面拍着你的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（秀太）这就是证据。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从现在起，这里将会发生和照片上一模一样的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.67,0:05:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.67,0:05:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.05,0:05:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.43,0:05:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我说的一样吧，呵呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.97,0:05:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可以改变未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.33,0:05:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，把那个未来拍成照片。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未来？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.14,0:05:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（秀太）所以我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决斗中绝对不会输！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又不是 No.卡吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.66,0:06:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.43,0:06:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.20,0:06:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.69,0:06:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那、那家伙是什么人啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.58,0:06:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张照片是在刚才那场事故发生之前拍下来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的能操纵未来这种事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么说来至今为止发表的独家照片也……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在干什么啊！我正赶时间呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快点出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.30,0:06:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个，姐姐……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你，是叫速见秀太吧你知道的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.51,0:06:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个讨人厌的家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.53,0:06:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是那个，是速见！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.87,0:07:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他参加了狂欢节你知道的吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.23,0:07:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为有多少人参加啊我哪知道啊，那种家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不想让他再引发更多事件了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.97,0:07:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事件？那是什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速见秀太{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他说自己拥有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.41,0:07:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以随心所欲掌控未来的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.39,0:07:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也不是百分之百相信。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，我看到了他把未来拍成了照片。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种家伙为什么会来参加决斗狂欢节？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.82,0:07:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道就是因为不知道才着急啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 他说正因为有那个力量 所以在决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.71,0:07:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也绝对不会输。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之 你给我去找速见秀太{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.43,0:07:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后尽快联系我听到没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 搞什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.82,0:07:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为能改变未来所以决斗绝对不会输？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但如果那是真的 那个男人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或许是被 No.卡附身了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被 No.卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.51,0:07:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有必要去确认一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:08:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 去找吧去找那个叫速见秀太的男人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 一个个的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都高高在上 以为自己是谁啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.72,0:08:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 小鸟 咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为你说了很过分的话所以她走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.07,0:08:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不记得了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我对小鸟？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能说那种话啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！小鸟？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.39,0:08:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《观察结果17。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人类有时会因脱口而出的一句话伤害到别人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}甚至连自己说过都不记得》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是白挨说了啊 小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.35,0:08:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马那家伙居然真的一个人骑上去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.31,0:09:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要从天上对游马做个鬼脸。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.67,0:09:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（秀太）好～啦，那么各位。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看这边哦，好。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.62,0:09:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）茄子！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.02,0:09:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前辈，速见前辈！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.82,0:09:25.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}观月君！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好久不见。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.06,0:09:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大概是一年前了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我拍了观月君的照片。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.11,0:09:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯，拍得特别漂亮，你给我拍的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.15,0:09:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在文化祭上展出的时候虽然有点不好意思……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.85,0:09:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我很开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.87,0:09:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张照片到现在都是我的自信之作。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.24,0:09:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是初中时代的美好回忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.93,0:09:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你一点都没变呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.45,0:09:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎……我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.84,0:10:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才也是 孩子们的笑容……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在也是 让大家感到安心的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.23,0:10:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}温柔的照片 一直在拍呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.69,0:10:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了。 能拍一张吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.62,0:10:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以飞艇为背景。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.14,0:10:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好的 当然可以！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.00,0:10:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说什么找到后通知一声{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.03,0:10:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我连那个讨人厌的…… 不对{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连那个叫速见的家伙长什么样都不知道{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.74,0:10:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我怎么找啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.43,0:10:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那边好像在进行决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.59,0:10:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…… 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.69,0:11:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.45,0:11:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.14,0:11:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能…… 被拍到照片里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.33,0:11:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然会变成现实怎么会　这么荒唐！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击敌方怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必杀影杀射击！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.11,0:11:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.31,0:11:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看吧　正如我所预言的那样…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你注定会在第４回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被埋葬的命运。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.22,0:11:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我拍下的照片　会映出未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.11,0:11:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且　它必定会…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.41,0:11:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化为现实。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.81,0:11:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张照片…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未来　预言…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙就是姐姐说过的映出未来…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.05,0:11:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂　你没事吧！　喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.23,0:11:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧送医院。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.57,0:11:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.09,0:11:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然是 No.持有者吗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力：哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.27,0:12:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你没事吧！喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 要把决斗搞成这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.30,0:12:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.66,0:12:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 是速见吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么啊…… 怎么会这样！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗是快乐的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗者 大家明明都应该是同伴{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.93,0:12:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 非得做到那种地步啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.79,0:12:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么…… 这不是明摆着的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了得到 No.卡啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可惜 刚才那个男的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也不是 No.卡使用者呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.41,0:12:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我会 继续寻找。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.43,0:12:51.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了把全世界的 No.卡都拿到手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.63,0:12:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 就能更加超厉害的照片……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.82,0:12:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能震惊全世界的那种{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.52,0:13:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大独家照片我相信一定能拍到！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.23,0:13:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙……完全
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.56,0:13:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被 No.给迷住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.77,0:13:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也知道吗 No.的存在！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.14,0:13:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道……难道你。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，有啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.34,0:13:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊。你也有 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。不过，不像你那样……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.11,0:13:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（摩托车声）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.45,0:13:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找到了就马上通知我我不是说过了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.64,0:13:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧……姐姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.01,0:13:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还记得我吗？速见秀太！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.37,0:13:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，刚出道的小记者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.73,0:13:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不记得也是当然的啦……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.09,0:13:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 你带来的那些照片
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都被毙掉了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}网络新闻的主编你还记得吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.49,0:13:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……我记得。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.36,0:13:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}报道照片需要冲击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你当时可是没少跟我说呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个主编说想跟你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}签合同来着{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:13:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可不答应。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:14:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了拍独家照片
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不惜把人命置于危险之中的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不答应！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把人命置于危险？真是冤枉啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.73,0:14:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只不过是想
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.45,0:14:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拍出好照片而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.77,0:14:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了这个就动用奇怪的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.47,0:14:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把未来扭曲掉 你是这个意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.82,0:14:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未来　能扭曲吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你引起的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.71,0:14:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场事故…「我啊　能随心所欲地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.14,0:14:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}操控未来」。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.57,0:14:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你当时这么说过吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的　我能做到。　用Numbers的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然你看到了应该就能相信我了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.69,0:14:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来　附在这个男人身上的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.31,0:14:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Numbers的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}似乎是能操控未来的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.71,0:14:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}操控？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.26,0:14:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张照片就给你了　能快点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}离开这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.31,0:14:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}交给主编的话他一定会很高兴的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.01,0:14:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可没在开玩笑。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我很忙的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.39,0:15:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来　我必须和他　进行决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.02,0:15:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.76,0:15:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，不可以。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.91,0:15:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么能跟这么危险的家伙决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈……你也是记者的话在这种地方{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}磨磨蹭蹭可不是时候吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.35,0:15:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了。就再送你一张{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}珍藏的独家照片当礼物吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.57,0:15:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其实还挺舍不得的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.93,0:15:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但为了让你从这儿离开，也没办法了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.31,0:15:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.51,0:15:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟酱！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.06,0:15:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们是她的熟人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可得抓紧了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很快，心园市上空{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.59,0:15:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞艇就要引擎故障引发事故。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.31,0:15:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张照片，是拍下坠机前一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}船内景象的独家大新闻照片。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.19,0:15:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一旦成真……不
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.07,0:15:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的照片，必定会化为现实。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后哈特兰城就会陷入大恐慌。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.80,0:15:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，赶紧把那张照片拿给主编看。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:16:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要在事故瞬间通过网络发布
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.03,0:16:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能给全世界带来冲击。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.55,0:16:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别再干这种蠢事了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢事是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟，回话！小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.12,0:16:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.02,0:16:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）干嘛啊，现在才联系我。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.65,0:16:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.44,0:16:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你现在在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马绝对追不过来的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.71,0:16:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道是飞艇？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你坐在飞艇上吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.77,0:16:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。不行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.95,0:16:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.35,0:16:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯，超开心的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能一览整个城镇，心情超好！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.52,0:16:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是问这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.73,0:16:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么异常吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.71,0:16:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？异常？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.73,0:16:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.75,0:16:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，你看那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀——！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.48,0:16:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}引擎！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}引擎怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.68,0:16:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）呀——！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟——！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.23,0:16:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你差不多给我适可而止吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.03,0:16:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快点住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:16:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.22,0:17:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为这就是现实啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是你扭曲出来的现实吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.01,0:17:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我恢复原样！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.16,0:17:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，太让人寒心了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.18,0:17:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也是记者的话我还以为你会高兴呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.71,0:17:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}记者不管是谁都对独家新闻毫无抵抗力吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.75,0:17:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你打我，现实也不会改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.46,0:17:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在我们这样耗着的时候飞艇的危机也在逼近。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞艇那边我来想办法。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.55,0:17:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不许从这家伙身上移开视线！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼……总算那个吵人的家伙不在了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.16,0:17:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，开始吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被 No.卡附身的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.05,0:17:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要在决斗中落败，失去 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.37,0:17:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会恢复理智对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.49,0:17:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.11,0:17:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要我打倒这家伙照片里拍到的未来也会消失{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.14,0:17:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟也就平安无事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.49,0:17:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}理论上是的。不过……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.85,0:17:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，秀太！决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.28,0:18:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像，连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.31,0:18:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗目标，锁定！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.03,0:18:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……你想干什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.05,0:18:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在拍摄你的未来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.91,0:18:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.79,0:18:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看吧这里映照着你的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.82,0:18:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗落败，被我把 No.卡夺走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.23,0:18:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的身影。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.70,0:18:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拍进照片里的未来是无法改变的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.57,0:18:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的胜利，还有你那凄惨的败北……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.77,0:18:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我按下快门的那一瞬间就已经确定了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.80,0:19:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……少开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的未来凭什么被你这种人随便决定啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.52,0:19:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.37,0:19:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻我就拿下了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.06,0:19:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.75,0:19:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将怪兽以里侧守备表示盖放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.95,0:19:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，我盖放一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.66,0:19:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.86,0:19:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤独家新闻射手！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（探察射手）哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.80,0:19:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马以里侧守备表示盖放的怪兽是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.33,0:19:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隆隆石魔。 其守备力是 1500。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.20,0:19:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与之相对探察射手的攻击力是 1400。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.07,0:19:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果就这样攻击的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能给对手造成伤害了……》
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.45,0:19:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动装备魔法 望远镜！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.99,0:19:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给探察射手装备 望远镜！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.27,0:20:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了这张卡的怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.96,0:20:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1张手牌 就提升 400点。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.83,0:20:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的手牌是 4张。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.35,0:20:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 提升 1600点。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《攻击力3000！ 但是 没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.41,0:20:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备表示的 隆隆石魔{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合只有一次不会被战斗破坏！》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.76,0:20:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 正负反转！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.17,0:20:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以选择1只里侧守备怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}翻转为表侧攻击表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.45,0:20:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 让那只怪兽的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力和守备力的数值也{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.49,0:20:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反转！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.02,0:20:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为使用了正负反转手牌 减少了1张。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.72,0:20:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 潜行狙击手的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降400点。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.10,0:20:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}倍率变更。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.12,0:20:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 有这些就足够了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.64,0:20:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 潜行狙击手！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击隆隆隆石人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（隆隆隆隆魔像）隆隆…… 隆～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.28,0:21:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.16,0:21:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.95,0:21:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在播报一则临时新闻。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.53,0:21:19.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园市上空的飞艇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.98,0:21:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}似乎发生了引擎故障。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.73,0:21:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.60,0:21:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.47,0:21:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事的…… 一定没事的……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.84,0:21:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.20,0:21:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我，小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.55,0:21:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会去救你的～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.43,0:21:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是注定的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.70,0:21:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才给你看的只是结果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而像这样，决斗的展开
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.64,0:21:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部都被我拍下来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.66,0:21:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在第5回合
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤出 No.39 希望皇霍普{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来的第6回合你会败在我的 No.卡手下。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.28,0:22:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我拍下的照片里，映照着未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.31,0:22:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且那一定会实现！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.39,0:24:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来复习一下心之拼图吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.41,0:24:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拼图的形状各不相同，得严丝合缝
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.43,0:24:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拼上去才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.61,0:24:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要拼上几块拼图
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.08,0:24:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由玩家之间商量决定，OK。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.48,0:24:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧集齐5块拼图把心拼完整吧！

